	(text "Individual Power Rail LEDs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 275.082 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "040c2b27-da5c-483c-b22c-c497f612a67c")
	)
	(text "5V from the backplane 	(+5V_BP)\n5V from the USB 		(VBUS)\n5V from the battery 	(+5V_BATT)\n* ALL ORing into +5V net*\n\n3.3V from the backplane	(+3.3V_BP)\n3.3V from LDO			(+3.3V_REG)\n* ALL ORing into +3.3V net *\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 252.984 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "06b06375-dc63-4fff-91df-817cf38deb20")
	)
	(text "VBATT Buck Converter\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.052 110.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "086c392c-a75d-4ae4-965c-8dfc7df9ed37")
	)
	(text "Over-current is mitigated through the use \nof a resettable PTC fuse. \n\nIout =~ 1.5A * 1.125 = 1.70A  \n(firing circuits, MCU, peripherals - with safety margin)\n\nV_max = 1.25 x 8.4V =~ 12-16V\nI_hold = Iout / 0.8 =~ 2.11 A\n\nI_trip = 2 (I_hold) =~ 4A\n\n----\n\nOver-voltage is mitigated with a TVS diode\nVBATT_max is 8.4V, a Vrwm of 9V+ is suitbable. \nThe SMAJ10A was selected.\nBreakdown @ 1.1, clamp @ 17V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 44.958 73.406 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "086d0af3-43bd-495e-9cab-b51ca3684762")
	)
	(text "A PMOS was selected for low Rds. \n(AO3401A, cheap, +-12V Vgs)\n\n10V Zener diode placed between source and gate\nto clamp Vgs to 10V. \n\nA resistor between the gate and GND\nsets a default ON state, and limits current\nto the Zener diode"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 103.124 64.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0f14f74f-450a-4d8b-a9a1-7931d5723741")
	)
	(text "Sets output voltage.\nVref is nominally 1V, fix R32 at 100k as per datasheet section 9.2.2.3\n\nR33 = R32 / (Vout / Vref - 1)\nR33 = 100k / (5 / 1 - 1) = 25k ~ 24.9k (standard)\n\n\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.606 180.086 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "11b90844-64f0-42ba-bc65-67322ed5df7e")
	)
