		(uuid "ea705655-3308-4169-b320-b02fdce24141")
	)
	(text "A feed-forward capacitor is used to improve load transient response, forming a high-pass filter\\\n\nCff < (Vout * Cout) / 120 * R32 * sqrt(Vref/Vout)\nC15 < (5 * 88u) / 120 * 100k * 0.4472 <~ 81.99 pF \n\nAccounting for capacitor derating and looking at standard E12 values:\nCff = 56pF (well below upper limit) \nSelected 47pF for availability"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.606 194.564 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ec692494-9822-44c9-87b9-c45b083679c9")
	)
	(text "VBATT Entry\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.988 21.082 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "efe7e295-eca3-45b0-816c-a643e76753e6")
	)
	(text "Irated = 2(Iout_max) = 2(1.70) = 3.40 A\n\nMinimize DCR, target 30-50mohm \nfor a V_drop of 50mV (DCR = 50m * 1.75) = 30 mohm\n\nDCR = 35 mOhm, Pmax = 35^2m * 1.7 = 107mW (this is fine)\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 102.362 86.614 0)
		(effects
